ting  than this  being right up close to these massive  ships the biggest ships in the world  yeah it's just amazing seeing them up  close life hasn't been the same for  anyone for the last few months  but one man in a boat has found a way to  capitalize on it for cbs this morning  saturday  holly williams near mudderford in  england  i love that guy i don't see the appeal  it's kind of cool i mean  you're on a cruise ship so you see from  the inside you never really look at it  right outside even from the dock you  wouldn't see it the same way  i just like the honesty of there's not  really a lot to do too so no five bucks  if you have the money  go see it go get out on the water five  times the size of the titanic  and a giraffe and a giraffe and gigi  gigi the giraffe
 

